{"strongs": "H6667", "word": "צִדְקִיָּ֫הוּ", "translit": "tsid.qiy.yah", "root": "צדקיהו", "morph": "N:N-M-P", "pos": "proper name, masculine", "gloss": "is righteousness", "definition": "צִדְקִיָּ֫הוּ 56 , יָּ֑ה 7 proper name, masculine ( ׳ י is righteousness ; compare Sabean צדקאל DHM ib., on No. 32 ); — σεδεκια ( ς ): 1. last king of Judah, מַתַּנְּיָה , changed to ׳ ׃צ יָּ֑֫הוּ 2Kgs 24:17 ; 2Kgs 24:18 ; 2Kgs 24:20 ; 2Kgs 25:2 ; 2Kgs 25:7 (twice in verse) = 2Chr 36:10 ; 2Chr 36:11 ; 1Chr 3:15 ; Jer 1:3 ; Jer 21:1 ; Jer 21:3 ; Jer 21:7 + 37 t. Jeremiah; יָּ֑ה Psalms; Jer 27:12 ; Jer 28:1 ; Jer 29:3 ; Jer 49:34 . 2. false prophets: \\ \\ a. under Ahab, יָּ֑֫הוּ 1Kgs 22:24 = 2Chr 18:10 ; 2Chr 18:23 יָּ֑ה 1Kgs 22:11 . \\ \\ b. יָּ֑֫הוּ Jeremiah's time, Jer 29:21 ; Jer 29:22 . 3. יָּ֑֫הוּ prince, Jeremiah's time, Jer 36:12 . 4. יָּ֑ה , priest, Nehemiah's time, Neh 10:2 ( ᵐ5 L Σεχενιας ). 5. יָּ֑ה , son of Jehoiachin, according to 1Chr 3:16 , but probably gloss, Be SS , compare Kit .", "definition_html": "<h1><entry onclick=\"bdbid('BDB6946')\">BDB6946</entry> [<entry onclick=\"sn('H6667')\">H6667</entry>]</h1><div class=\"navigation\"><entry onclick=\"bdbid('BDB6945')\">BDB6945</entry> | BIBLICAL HEBREW | <entry onclick=\"bdbid('BDB6947')\">BDB6947</entry></div><p> <bdbheb>צִדְקִיָּ֫הוּ</bdbheb><sub>56</sub>, <bdbheb>יָּ֑ה</bdbheb><sub>7</sub> <b>proper name, masculine</b> (<bdbheb>׳</bdbheb><bdbheb>י</bdbheb> <highlight>is righteousness</highlight>; compare Sabean <bdbheb>צדקאל</bdbheb> <lookup onclick=\"bdbabb('DHM')\">DHM<sup>ib., on No. 32</sup></lookup>); — <grk>σεδεκια</grk>(<grk>ς</grk>): <div class=\"point\"><b>1.</b> last king of Judah, <bdbheb>מַתַּנְּיָה</bdbheb>, changed to <bdbheb>׳</bdbheb><bdbheb>׃צ</bdbheb> <bdbheb>יָּ֑֫הוּ</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"2Kgs 24:17\" b=\"12\" cBegin=\"24\" vBegin=\"17\" cEnd=\"24\" vEnd=\"17\" onclick=\"bcv(12,24,17)\">2Kgs 24:17</ref>; <ref ref=\"2Kgs 24:18\" b=\"12\" cBegin=\"24\" vBegin=\"18\" cEnd=\"24\" vEnd=\"18\" onclick=\"bcv(12,24,18)\">2Kgs 24:18</ref>; <ref ref=\"2Kgs 24:20\" b=\"12\" cBegin=\"24\" vBegin=\"20\" cEnd=\"24\" vEnd=\"20\" onclick=\"bcv(12,24,20)\">2Kgs 24:20</ref>; <ref ref=\"2Kgs 25:2\" b=\"12\" cBegin=\"25\" vBegin=\"2\" cEnd=\"25\" vEnd=\"2\" onclick=\"bcv(12,25,2)\">2Kgs 25:2</ref>; <ref ref=\"2Kgs 25:7\" b=\"12\" cBegin=\"25\" vBegin=\"7\" cEnd=\"25\" vEnd=\"7\" onclick=\"bcv(12,25,7)\">2Kgs 25:7</ref> (twice in verse) = <ref ref=\"2Chr 36:10\" b=\"14\" cBegin=\"36\" vBegin=\"10\" cEnd=\"36\" vEnd=\"10\" onclick=\"bcv(14,36,10)\">2Chr 36:10</ref>; <ref ref=\"2Chr 36:11\" b=\"14\" cBegin=\"36\" vBegin=\"11\" cEnd=\"36\" vEnd=\"11\" onclick=\"bcv(14,36,11)\">2Chr 36:11</ref>; <ref ref=\"1Chr 3:15\" b=\"13\" cBegin=\"3\" vBegin=\"15\" cEnd=\"3\" vEnd=\"15\" onclick=\"bcv(13,3,15)\">1Chr 3:15</ref>; <ref ref=\"Jer 1:3\" b=\"24\" cBegin=\"1\" vBegin=\"3\" cEnd=\"1\" vEnd=\"3\" onclick=\"bcv(24,1,3)\">Jer 1:3</ref>; <ref ref=\"Jer 21:1\" b=\"24\" cBegin=\"21\" vBegin=\"1\" cEnd=\"21\" vEnd=\"1\" onclick=\"bcv(24,21,1)\">Jer 21:1</ref>; <ref ref=\"Jer 21:3\" b=\"24\" cBegin=\"21\" vBegin=\"3\" cEnd=\"21\" vEnd=\"3\" onclick=\"bcv(24,21,3)\">Jer 21:3</ref>; <ref ref=\"Jer 21:7\" b=\"24\" cBegin=\"21\" vBegin=\"7\" cEnd=\"21\" vEnd=\"7\" onclick=\"bcv(24,21,7)\">Jer 21:7</ref> + 37 t. Jeremiah; <bdbheb>יָּ֑ה</bdbheb> Psalms; <ref ref=\"Jer 27:12\" b=\"24\" cBegin=\"27\" vBegin=\"12\" cEnd=\"27\" vEnd=\"12\" onclick=\"bcv(24,27,12)\">Jer 27:12</ref>; <ref ref=\"Jer 28:1\" b=\"24\" cBegin=\"28\" vBegin=\"1\" cEnd=\"28\" vEnd=\"1\" onclick=\"bcv(24,28,1)\">Jer 28:1</ref>; <ref ref=\"Jer 29:3\" b=\"24\" cBegin=\"29\" vBegin=\"3\" cEnd=\"29\" vEnd=\"3\" onclick=\"bcv(24,29,3)\">Jer 29:3</ref>; <ref ref=\"Jer 49:34\" b=\"24\" cBegin=\"49\" vBegin=\"34\" cEnd=\"49\" vEnd=\"34\" onclick=\"bcv(24,49,34)\">Jer 49:34</ref>.</p></div><div class=\"section\"><p> </div><div class=\"point\"><b>2.</b> false prophets: <br>\\&emsp;\\&emsp;<b>a.</b> under Ahab, <bdbheb>יָּ֑֫הוּ</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"1Kgs 22:24\" b=\"11\" cBegin=\"22\" vBegin=\"24\" cEnd=\"22\" vEnd=\"24\" onclick=\"bcv(11,22,24)\">1Kgs 22:24</ref> = <ref ref=\"2Chr 18:10\" b=\"14\" cBegin=\"18\" vBegin=\"10\" cEnd=\"18\" vEnd=\"10\" onclick=\"bcv(14,18,10)\">2Chr 18:10</ref>; <ref ref=\"2Chr 18:23\" b=\"14\" cBegin=\"18\" vBegin=\"23\" cEnd=\"18\" vEnd=\"23\" onclick=\"bcv(14,18,23)\">2Chr 18:23</ref> <bdbheb>יָּ֑ה</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"1Kgs 22:11\" b=\"11\" cBegin=\"22\" vBegin=\"11\" cEnd=\"22\" vEnd=\"11\" onclick=\"bcv(11,22,11)\">1Kgs 22:11</ref>. <br>\\&emsp;\\&emsp;<b>b.</b> <bdbheb>יָּ֑֫הוּ</bdbheb> Jeremiah's time, <ref ref=\"Jer 29:21\" b=\"24\" cBegin=\"29\" vBegin=\"21\" cEnd=\"29\" vEnd=\"21\" onclick=\"bcv(24,29,21)\">Jer 29:21</ref>; <ref ref=\"Jer 29:22\" b=\"24\" cBegin=\"29\" vBegin=\"22\" cEnd=\"29\" vEnd=\"22\" onclick=\"bcv(24,29,22)\">Jer 29:22</ref>. </div><div class=\"point\"><b>3.</b> <bdbheb>יָּ֑֫הוּ</bdbheb> prince, Jeremiah's time, <ref ref=\"Jer 36:12\" b=\"24\" cBegin=\"36\" vBegin=\"12\" cEnd=\"36\" vEnd=\"12\" onclick=\"bcv(24,36,12)\">Jer 36:12</ref>. </div><div class=\"point\"><b>4.</b> <bdbheb>יָּ֑ה</bdbheb>, priest, Nehemiah's time, <ref ref=\"Neh 10:2\" b=\"16\" cBegin=\"10\" vBegin=\"2\" cEnd=\"10\" vEnd=\"2\" onclick=\"bcv(16,10,2)\">Neh 10:2</ref> (<lookup onclick=\"bdbabb('Sept')\"><bdbheb><reflink>ᵐ5</reflink></bdbheb><reflink><sup>L</sup></reflink></lookup> <grk>Σεχενιας</grk>). </div><div class=\"point\"><b>5.</b> <bdbheb>יָּ֑ה</bdbheb>, son of Jehoiachin, according to <ref ref=\"1Chr 3:16\" b=\"13\" cBegin=\"3\" vBegin=\"16\" cEnd=\"3\" vEnd=\"16\" onclick=\"bcv(13,3,16)\">1Chr 3:16</ref>, but probably gloss, <lookup onclick=\"bdbabb('Be')\">Be</lookup> <lookup onclick=\"bdbabb('SS')\">SS</lookup>, compare <lookup onclick=\"bdbabb('Kit')\">Kit</lookup>. </p></div><hr>", "references": [{"raw": "2Kgs 24:17", "book": "2KI", "chapter": 24, "verse": 17}, {"raw": "2Kgs 24:18", "book": "2KI", "chapter": 24, "verse": 18}, {"raw": "2Kgs 24:20", "book"